,789,790],{},"redirect_uri"," error",[535,793,794],{},"The sign-in redirect URI in Okta doesn't exactly match Kinotic's callback URL. Copy it again from the provider in Kinotic and replace it in Okta",[520,796,797,800],{},[535,798,799],{},"Okta says the user isn't assigned to the app",[535,801,802,803,805],{},"Assign the user, or a group they belong to, under the app's ",[278,804,423],{}," tab",[520,807,808,811],{},[535,809,810],{},"The login page doesn't show the Okta button",[535,812,813,814,816,817],{},"Check that the provider is ",[278,815,610],{}," under ",[278,818,819],{},"Organization settings > Authentication providers",{"title":821,"searchDepth":509,"depth":509,"links":822},"",[823,824,825,826,827,828,829],{"id":288,"depth":509,"text":289},{"id":313,"depth":509,"text":314},{"id":443,"depth":509,"text":444},{"id":483,"depth":509,"text":484},{"id":688,"depth":509,"text":689},{"id":741,"depth":509,"text":742},{"id":767,"depth":509,"text":768},"Configure Okta as a single sign-on provider for your Kinotic organization.","md",null,{},{"icon":47},{"title":44,"description":830},"CLGtlr0joWps6B46NV2dWJff5M0oqn3tJxb5Y3MYj6A",[838,840],{"title":31,"path":41,"stem":42,"description":839,"icon":36,"children":-1},"Let your organization's members sign in to the Kinotic portal with your own identity provider.",{"title":31,"path":61,"stem":62,"description":841,"children":-1},"Understand how Kinotic apps are organized -- from organizations down to individual artifacts.",1792930938107]